Pi wakes with 0 words of its own.
day 1 (numbers): 8 tried, 8 new, 8 memories (with dreams)
  night: new word w0(a: I) -> I = (n * a)   (saves 6)
  night: awake words -- numbers 1, lists 0, text 0, grids 0 (of 1)
  dreams: w0(w0(w0(n))); w0(w0(w0(2))); w0((w0(n) - n))
day 2 (lists): 8 tried, 8 new, 19 memories (with dreams)
  night: awake words -- numbers 1, lists 0, text 0, grids 0 (of 1)
  dreams: drop(3, rev(x)); filter(e -> (e == (3 + 3)), x); map(e -> (e + 1), x); (3 - minl(x))
day 3 (text): 8 tried, 8 new, 31 memories (with dreams)
  night: new word w1(a: F) -> L = map(a, x)   (saves 5)
  night: awake words -- numbers 1, lists 1, text 1, grids 0 (of 2)
  dreams: w1((3 - e)); w1((e - 3)); w1((e * 3)); (-1 + maxl(x))
day 4 (grids): 8 tried, 8 new, 43 memories (with dreams)
  night: awake words -- numbers 1, lists 1, text 1, grids 0 (of 2)
  dreams: gmap(e -> (3 * 3), g); (nobj(g) % 2)
day 5 (numbers): 8 tried, 8 new, 53 memories (with dreams)
  night: new word w2(a: I) -> I = w0(w0(a))   (saves 14)
  night: new word w3(a: I) -> I = (a + w0(n))   (saves 4)
  night: awake words -- numbers 3, lists 1, text 1, grids 0 (of 4)
  dreams: w2(w3(w3(n))); (n + w2(w3(n))); w0(w2(w3(3))); w0(w2(w3(n)))
day 6 (numbers): 2 tried, 2 new, 59 memories (with dreams)
  night: awake words -- numbers 3, lists 1, text 1, grids 0 (of 4)
  dreams: w0(w2(w2(3))); w0(w2(w2(n))); w3(w3(binom(n, n))); (w2(2) + (3 % (w3(3) - n)))
day 7 (lists): 8 tried, 8 new, 71 memories (with dreams)
  night: new word w4(a: L) -> L = filter(e -> (0 < e), a)   (saves 8)
  night: awake words -- numbers 3, lists 2, text 1, grids 0 (of 5)
  dreams: w1((0 - 3)); w1((e + 3)); sum((x ++ w1(2))); w1((e - 1))
day 8 (lists): 7 tried, 7 new, 82 memories (with dreams)
  night: new word w5(a: L) -> L = filter(e -> (0 == (e % 2)), a)   (saves 6)
  night: awake words -- numbers 3, lists 3, text 1, grids 0 (of 6)
  dreams: last(w4(w1((e + 2)))); (3 - last(x)); w1((3 * 3)); (2 * last(x))
day 9 (text): 2 tried, 2 new, 88 memories (with dreams)
  night: awake words -- numbers 3, lists 3, text 1, grids 0 (of 6)
  dreams: (head(x) % 2); w1((e + 2)); w1((e + e)); w1((e % 2))
day 10 (grids): 2 tried, 2 new, 94 memories (with dreams)
  night: new word w6(a: G) -> G = gmap(e -> recolour(e, 1->5), a)   (saves 4)
  night: awake words -- numbers 3, lists 3, text 1, grids 1 (of 7)
  dreams: gmap(e -> (1 + 3), g); gmap(e -> colourmap(e, 1->5 2->0 3->5), g); w6(gvcat(g, g)); w6(ghcat(g, g))
day 11: nothing left to learn -- Pi rests
  dreams: w2(w2(sigma(3))); w0(w3(w3(n))); w0(w3(binom(n, n))); w2(w2(w3(n))); take(sum(x), x); rev(w5(drop(3, x))); (min(0, last(x)) - 2); w1((0 - e)); w1((0 - 2)); tail(w1((e // 3))); (len(x) + sum(x)); (3 + (head(x) + sum(w1(2)))); gmap(e -> colourmap(e, 1->-3 0->2 2->0 3->-1), g); gflipv(gscale(2, w6(g))); gmap(e -> colourmap(e, 1->-4 0->1 2->-1 3->-2), g)
  dreams: ndig(w0(w2(n))); w0(w2(w2(2))); w2(max(1, w2(n))); w3(max(n, w2(n))); (sum(w1((e % 3))) // 2); min(3, (2 * sum(x))); (-2 + last(x)); take(minl(w5(x)), x); w1((2 - e)); (head(x) % 3); (2 * sum(w1(2))); w1((e * e)); gfliph(gtrans(w6(g))); gmap(e -> colourmap(e, 1->2 0->-3 2->-1 3->0), g)
surprises (outcome differed from Pi's own prediction): 4

what Pi knows, in its own words:
  x^2: w0(n)
  x^2 + 1: w3(1)
  2x + 1: (n + (n + 1))
  x^3: w2(n)
  (x+1)^2: (1 + w0((n + 2)))
  x^2 + x: w3(n)
  x // 2 + 1: (1 + (n // 2))
  x % 3: (n % 3)
  max(x, 2): max(n, 2)
  x^4: w2(w0(n))
  x^4 + 1: (1 + w2(w0(n)))
  x^5: w2(w2(n))
  x^6: w2(w2(w0(n)))
  (x^2+1)^2: (1 + w2(w3(2)))
  x^8: fold((acc, e) -> (acc * acc), n, upto(3))
  (x^2+x)^2: (2 * (w2(n) + sum(upto(w0(n)))))
  even stays, odd becomes 0: w0((w3(1) % 2))
  small numbers doubled: (n + min(n, w0(binom(2, n))))
  sum: sum(x)
  length: len(x)
  reverse: rev(x)
  sort: sort(x)
  double each: w1((e + e))
  add one to each: w1((e + 1))
  square each: w1((e * e))
  keep positives: w4(x)
  keep evens: w5(x)
  count positives: len(w4(x))
  sum of squares: sum(w1((e * e)))
  largest: maxl(x)
  spread: (maxl(x) - minl(x))
  sort descending: rev(sort(x))
  sum of positives: sum(w4(x))
  squares sorted: sort(w1((e * e)))
  two smallest: take(2, sort(x))
  count evens: (len(x) - sum(w1((e % 2))))
  sum of evens: sum(w5(x))
  largest two, biggest first: take(2, rev(sort(x)))
  clamp negatives to zero: w1(if((e < 0), 0, e))
  product: fold((acc, e) -> (acc * e), 1, x)
  product of squares: fold((acc, e) -> (acc * e), 1, (x ++ x))
  reverse the word: rev(x)
  word length: len(x)
  first letter: head(x)
  uppercase: w1((e + -32))
  mirror: (x ++ rev(x))
  next letter of each: w1((e + 1))
  letters after m: filter(e -> (109 < e), x)
  first letter as capital: (-32 + head(x))
  uppercase, reversed: rev(w1((e + -32)))
  letters before n: filter(e -> (e < 110), x)
  flip upside down: gflipv(g)
  mirror left-right: gfliph(g)
  transpose: gtrans(g)
  height: gh(g)
  width: gw(g)
  rotate 180: gflipv(gfliph(g))
  rotate right: gfliph(gtrans(g))
  rotate left: gflipv(gtrans(g))
  recolour 1 to 5: w6(g)
  recolour 1 to 5, then flip: gflipv(w6(g))

never practised:
  x^7:  without: not found   with: w2(w2(w2(n)))
  x^10:  without: (max(1, (n * n)) * fold((acc, e) -> (acc * acc), n, upto(3)))   with: w0(w2(w2(w2(w2(n)))))
  x^4 + x^2:  without: (2 * sum(upto((n * n))))   with: w2(w3(1))
  x^6 + 1:  without: not found   with: (1 + w0(w2(w2(n))))
  x^3 + 1:  without: (1 + (n * (n * n)))   with: (1 + w2(n))
  x^5 + x:  without: not found   with: (n + w2(w2(n)))
  even stays, odd becomes 0, plus 1:  without: (n + (1 - (n * (n % 2))))   with: (1 + w0((w3(1) % 2)))
  small numbers doubled, plus 1:  without: (n + (1 + if((n < 3), n, 0)))   with: ((n + 1) + min(n, w0(binom(2, n))))
  sum of doubles:  without: (2 * sum(x))   with: (2 * sum(x))
  count negatives:  without: len(filter(e -> (e < 0), x))   with: len(filter(e -> (e < 0), x))
  largest square:  without: maxl(map(e -> (e * e), x))   with: maxl(w1((e * e)))
  three smallest:  without: take(3, sort(x))   with: take(3, sort(x))
  positives sorted:  without: sort(filter(e -> (0 < e), x))   with: sort(w4(x))
  squares of positives:  without: not found   with: map(e -> (e * e), w4(x))
  evens, biggest first:  without: not found   with: rev(sort(w5(x)))
  smallest even:  without: minl(filter(e -> (0 == (e % 2)), x))   with: minl(w5(x))
  product of positives:  without: not found   with: fold((acc, e) -> (acc * e), 1, w4(x))
  sum after clamping negatives:  without: sum(filter(e -> (0 < e), x))   with: sum(w4(x))
  product of evens:  without: not found   with: fold((acc, e) -> (acc * e), 1, w5(x))
  uppercase first three:  without: take(3, map(e -> (e + -32), x))   with: take(3, w1((e + -32)))
  count letters after m:  without: not found   with: len(filter(e -> (109 < e), x))
  last letter as capital:  without: (-32 + last(x))   with: (-32 + last(x))
  uppercase, sorted:  without: sort(map(e -> (e + -32), x))   with: sort(w1((e + -32)))
  letters after m, reversed:  without: rev(filter(e -> (109 < e), x))   with: rev(filter(e -> (109 < e), x))
  rotate right, recolour 1 to 5:  without: gfliph(gtrans(gmap(e -> recolour(e, 1->5), g)))   with: gfliph(gtrans(w6(g)))
  mirror, recolour 1 to 7:  without: gfliph(gmap(e -> recolour(e, 1->7), g))   with: gfliph(gmap(e -> recolour(e, 1->7), g))
  area:  without: (gh(g) * gw(g))   with: (gh(g) * gw(g))
  rotate left, then flip:  without: gtrans(g)   with: gtrans(g)
  rotate right twice, recolour 1 to 4:  without: gflipv(gfliph(gmap(e -> recolour(e, 1->4), g)))   with: gflipv(gfliph(gmap(e -> recolour(e, 1->4), g)))
